00:16:50,360 --> 00:16:52,360
Once the skill is demonstrated,

296
00:16:52,360 --> 00:16:54,360
it has to be practiced.

297
00:16:54,360 --> 00:16:56,360
So part of the preparation stage

298
00:16:56,360 --> 00:16:58,360
and a plan so that Scouts

299
00:16:58,360 --> 00:17:00,360
can actually do the thing

300
00:17:00,360 --> 00:17:02,360
that you're demonstrating,

