00:17:40,360 --> 00:17:42,360
By attending and being prepared

321
00:17:42,360 --> 00:17:44,360
to participate in the events

322
00:17:44,360 --> 00:17:46,360
that the patrol leaders council plans.

323
00:17:46,360 --> 00:17:48,360
How do Scouts know about these events?

