00:17:48,360 --> 00:17:50,360
Patrol leaders communicate the details

325
00:17:50,360 --> 00:17:52,360
a Scout needs to know

326
00:17:52,360 --> 00:17:54,360
is prepared for activities and events.

327
00:17:54,360 --> 00:17:56,360
Patrol leaders instruct

328
00:17:56,360 --> 00:17:58,360
and train the Scouts so that they know the skills

329
00:17:58,360 --> 00:18:00,360
and complete the preparations

330
00:18:00,360 --> 00:18:02,360
for what they're about to do.

331
00:18:02,360 --> 00:18:04,360
What are the three steps to making things happen?

332
00:18:04,360 --> 00:18:06,360
Planning, preparation and execution.

333
00:18:06,360 --> 00:18:08,360
So what I'm aiming at in 15 minutes

334
00:18:08,360 --> 00:18:10,360
is getting the patrol leaders

335
00:18:10,360 --> 00:18:12,360
a simple, succinct

336
00:18:12,360 --> 00:18:14,360
set of ideas

337
00:18:14,360 --> 00:18:16,360
that are easy to remember.

338
00:18:16,360 --> 00:18:18,360
Now, arguably, this is a really simplistic approach

339
00:18:18,360 --> 00:18:20,360
to some complex issues.

340
00:18:20,360 --> 00:18:22,360
In 15 minutes I'm not trying

341
00:18:22,360 --> 00:18:24,360
to unload 2 tons of information,

342
00:18:24,360 --> 00:18:26,360
just the high points, just the bullet points.

343
00:18:26,360 --> 00:18:28,360
There is going to be

